{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12945","headline":"代书寄上李广州 · 独孤及","name":"代书寄上李广州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皖水望番禺，迢迢青天末。\n鸿鴈飞不到，音尘何由达。\n独有舆人歌，隔云声諠聒。\n皆称府君仁，百越赖全活。\n推诚鱼鳖信，持正魑魅怛。\n疲民保中和，性足无夭阏。\n天子咨四岳，伫公济方割。\n几时复旋归，入践青琐闼。\n贱子托明德，缭若松上葛。\n别离鄙恡生，结念思所豁。\n门栏关山阻，岐路天地阔。\n唯凭万里书，持用慰饥渴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}